FttLawTester","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Fitts\u2019 Law predicts movement-time as a function of distance (to the center of the target) and required accuracy (the size of the target). It can be described using the following formula.  MT = a + b \u00d7 ID;  ID = log2(2A/W)  Where MT is task completion time, ID is the index of difficulty, A (amplitude) is the distance to the center of the target and W (width) is the width of the (square) target. This program will help us to collect data so that we can calculate the coefficients a and b in the future.  ","topics":[],"score":153539,"global_rank":428172},{"name":"ZapDragon/Hykkota-Launcher","owner":"ZapDragon","html_url":"https://github.com/ZapDragon/Hykkota-Launcher","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Open Source Minecraft Launcher","topics":[],"score":153539,"global_rank":428173},{"name":"laurens914/iOSWeek3","owner":"laurens914","html_url":"https://github.com/laurens914/iOSWeek3","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":153539,"global_rank":428174},{"name":"sbeckeriv/vimconfigs","owner":"sbeckeriv","html_url":"https://github.com/sbeckeriv/vimconfigs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":153533,"global_rank":428175},{"name":"jasonmfehr/financial_manager","owner":"jasonmfehr","html_url":"https://github.com/jasonmfehr/financial_manager","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":153533,"global_rank":428176},{"name":"eywalker/test_travis","owner":"eywalker","html_url":"https://github.com/eywalker/test_travis","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Repository to test Travis CI","topics":[],"score":153526,"global_rank":428177},{"name":"gwander/Java","owner":"gwander","html_url":"https://github.com/gwander/Java",